  "content": "\n\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5tOAw0b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1918\" height=\"1019\"></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>簡介：</strong>這是一個以動畫《約會大作戰》為主題的純介面資源包「《約會大作戰》自訂介面包」。您可以將其覆蓋在您現有的資源包之上，與其他資源包自由搭配使用。本資源包採用藍、紫、粉紅色的客製化配色方案，並為每個介面容器（包含快捷欄）提供了自訂圖片。未來的更新可能會加入其他配色方案，例如紅黑配色。如果您發現任何錯誤，請回報給我，以便我盡快修復。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>社群互動：</strong>&nbsp;加入我們的 Discord 伺服器，建議並投票選出下一個資源包，參與動漫討論，每月還有機會贏取 Discord Nitro 贈品。&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://discord.gg/RvScgzj3Ph\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Discord 伺服器</span><br></a></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://listar-mc.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5uXVdKj.gif\" width=\"614\" height=\"345\"></a><br></strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://listar-mc.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bYZtcXk.png\" width=\"610\" height=\"332\"></a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>功能亮點：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>選項選單</strong><strong><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bppGs59.png\" alt=\"選項選單\" width=\"780\" height=\"430\"></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>HUD：<br></strong>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JzBbbEj.png\" alt=\"HUD\" width=\"780\" height=\"430\"></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>鐵砧：</strong>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VOASB66.png\" alt=\"鐵砧\" width=\"780\" height=\"430\"></li>\n<li><strong>鍛造台：</strong>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ylxulqK.png\" alt=\"鍛造台\" width=\"780\" height=\"430\"></li>\n<li><strong>工作台：</strong>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GURAC8t.png\" alt=\"工作台\" width=\"780\" height=\"430\"></li>\n<li><strong>釀造台：</strong>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RyV9C3o.png\" alt=\"釀造台\" width=\"780\" height=\"430\"></li>\n<li><strong>馬匹背包：</strong>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/v5eiT4U.png\" alt=\"馬匹背包\" width=\"780\" height=\"430\"></li>\n<li><strong>燻製台：</strong>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lpYA8yI.png\" alt=\"燻製台\" width=\"780\" height=\"430\"></li>\n<li><strong>熔爐：</strong>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6WLqYAs.png\" alt=\"熔爐\" width=\"780\" height=\"430\"></li>\n<li><strong>箱子：</strong>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yMJOJDK.png\" alt=\"箱子\" width=\"780\" height=\"430\"></li>\n<li><strong>投擲器：</strong>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3VDoAXO.png\" alt=\"投擲器\" width=\"780\" height=\"430\"></li>\n<li><strong>背包：</strong>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/03RjSX3.png\" alt=\"背包\" width=\"780\" height=\"430\"></li>\n<li><strong>村民交易選單：</strong>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4qZBgYD.png\" alt=\"村民交易選單\" width=\"780\" height=\"430\"></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=http://www.listar-mc.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/n6lVJOX.gif\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>點擊上方圖片，瀏覽我們重新上線的網站以查看更多內容！！&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/RvScgzj3Ph\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/H6j1NeD.png\" width=\"338\" height=\"127\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>點擊圖片加入 Discord</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.buymeacoffee.com/listarMc\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.ko-fi.com/cdn/kofi2.png?v=3\" alt=\"在 ko-fi.com 請我喝杯咖啡\" width=\"161\" height=\"41\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"te